The '''Ashas Ree Sith temple'''<ref name="Concept Art">{{SW|url=the-relic-raider-concept-art-gallery|text="The Relic Raider" Concept Art Gallery}} {{C|Slide 6}}</ref> was a [[Sith temple]] was located on the [[planet]] [[Ashas Ree]]. It contained a [[Unidentified Sith relic|relic]] that served as an immense power source. The relic was guarded by a number of traps throughout the [[Sith]] temple, activated by pressure plates in the floor as well as touching the relic itself. Eventually, the temple was buried and a [[Ashas Ree Temple of the Force|Jedi temple]] was constructed atop it in an effort to seal the temple's [[Dark side of the Force|dark power]].<ref name="The Relic Raiders" />

Although the temple was long buried, residents of the [[Ashas Ree outpost|outpost]] nearby were aware of rumors and legends about it,<ref name="The Relic Raiders" /> and in [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> the outpost's residents fled when the temple was unearthed by [[Mika Grey]], who was attempting to retrieve the relic inside before the [[First Order]] could find it. Grey was trapped inside the temple by one of its traps, until being [[Mission to Ashas Ree|discovered]] and released by ''[[Colossus]]'' residents [[Kazuda Xiono]], [[Eila]], [[Kel]] and [[CB-23]] a few [[Standard day|days]] later. The temple was then destroyed when Xiono accidentally activated a [[Sith]] glyph that caused it to collapse.<ref name="The Relic Raiders" />
